<i>♪ In the end, it's just love ♪</i>

632
01:21:11.617 --> 01:21:15.913
<i>♪ In the end, it's just love ♪</i>

633
01:21:19.875 --> 01:21:21.418
<i>♪ Love ♪</i>

634
01:21:23.629 --> 01:21:26.673
<i>♪ In the end, it's just love ♪</i>

635
01:21:29.134 --> 01:21:32.930
<i>♪ In the end, it's just love ♪</i>

636
01:21:35.307 --> 01:21:38.894
<i>♪ In the end, it's just love ♪</i>
